B.ayJ=new A.cF("What is AI Hand Analysis?","In the Hand Replayer, tap the AI chip to get a full coaching breakdown of a recorded hand. The analysis covers pre-flop decisions, post-flop play, sizing tells, and specific spots where you may have deviated from optimal lines \u2014 with actionable suggestions.")
B.ayT=new A.cF("What is AI Session Analysis?","From a session detail view, tap Analyze to get an AI summary of your overall session performance. The analysis looks at your logged stats, notes, and context to identify patterns, tilt indicators, and areas of focus for your next session.")
B.az9=new A.cF("Is there a limit on AI analysis?","Yes \u2014 AI analysis uses a cloud model and has daily usage limits to keep the service fast and fair: 20 hand analyses and 5 session analyses per day. Results are cached, so re-opening the same analysis doesn't count against your limit.")
